Chapter: Method Specialization
  cites Codex chapter Build Settings (max-recursion-depth)
  cites Emit chapter IR Text Emitter (ir-quote, ir-cat, ir-emit-type, safe-int-text)
  cites Codex chapter AST Nodes (ast-real-qual-app-p, ast-tparam-name-p)
  cites Codex chapter CdxCodes (cdx-type-mismatch)
  cites Codex chapter Desugarer (desugar-origin-schema, instance-specialize-type)
